---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact | Math Worksheet Studio" description="Contact Math Worksheet Studio about worksheet errors, printing, accessibility or feedback." canonicalPath="/contact/">
<div class="container"><article class="simple-copy">
 <h1>Contact Math Worksheet Studio</h1>
 <p>Questions, worksheet corrections, PDF printing issues or accessibility reports: <a href="mailto:contact@mathworksheetstudio.com">contact@mathworksheetstudio.com</a>.</p>
 <p>For a reproducible worksheet issue, please include the math topic, seed, difficulty, selected options and generator version when possible. Do not include student names, completed worksheets or other private personal information.</p>
 <p>You can also report a technical bug through the public <a href="https://github.com/garrison2025/Math_Works/issues">GitHub issue tracker</a>; public issues are visible to everyone, so never include student information.</p>
 <p>Math Worksheet Studio is an independent educational tool and does not offer individual tutoring, school certification or curriculum accreditation.</p>
</article></div>
</Layout>
